  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The fund expects to make 10-15 investments between US$3-7.5 million in various sectors with a special focus on agri-business/processing, fast moving consumer goods, ICT, health/pharmaceuticals, mining services and tourism. In addition to providing capital, the fund will also provide valuable intellectual capital, particularly in finance and reporting, as well as environmental, social and governance frameworks.</narrative>
